    "description": "Welcome to 122 Girard Avenue, where comfortable living meets everyday convenience in North Fayetteville.\n\nThis spacious 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom home offers approximately 1,000 square feet of well-planned living space, making it a great fit for anyone looking for privacy, functionality, and a convenient location. With two full bathrooms, mornings are easier, guests have their own space, and the layout provides flexibility for a second bedroom, home office, or additional living space.\n\nStep outside onto your private back deck, a comfortable spot for morning coffee, unwinding after work, or enjoying a quiet evening outdoors.\n\nInside, the kitchen comes equipped with the essentials, including a refrigerator, range, dishwasher, and garbage disposal. A heat pump provides heating and cooling, while the fireplace adds character and a warm focal point to the living area.\n\nLocated in an established fourplex community, 122 Girard Avenue puts you close to shopping, schools, everyday services, and I-295, providing convenient access throughout Fayetteville and the surrounding area.\n\nProperty Features\n\n• 2 spacious bedrooms\n• 2 full bathrooms\n• Approximately 1,000 sq. ft.\n• Private back deck\n• Refrigerator\n• Range\n• Dishwasher\n• Garbage disposal\n• Heat pump\n• Decorative fireplace\n• Fourplex setting\n• Convenient access to I-295\n• Close to shopping and schools\n\nIf you're looking for a comfortable home with a practical layout, private outdoor space, and a location that keeps you connected to Fayetteville, 122 Girard Avenue is ready to welcome you home.\n\nSchedule your showing and see what makes this property worth calling home.",
